      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فنّقهُ</span></b> , (S,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَفْنِيقٌ</span>; (O, K;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فانقهُ</span></b> ,
(S, O,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِنَاقٌ</span>; (TA;) <i>He made him to
enjoy,</i> or <i>lead, a plentiful, and a pleasant</i> or <i>an
easy, and a soft</i> or <i>delicate, life;</i> or <i>a life of ease
and plenty.</i> (S, O, K.)

